2. the axial and/or radial retaining mechanism;
3. the loading sequence for installing the stamping foil reel;
4. the unloading sequence for removing the reel; and
5. the interaction of the spindle, reel core, locking members, guides, and actuating components,

using patent terminology and the reference numerals appearing in the disclosure.
